the point is a cell centre, not a locality.
\item \code{gbif_issue}, \code{basis_of_record}, \code{establishment_means}: GBIF flags,
living or fossil specimens, cultivated or introduced plants.
\item \code{coord_uncertainty}: uncertainty above \code{max_coord_unc_m} (and, with
\code{drop_na_uncertainty}, records without one: \code{no_coord_uncertainty}).
\item \code{coarse_decimals}: both coordinates written with few decimals.
\item \code{garden_text}, \code{settlement_text}: gardens, car parks, campsites, etc.
