\item \code{country_mismatch}: outside the stated country, with a tolerance buffer
(\code{CoordinateCleaner::cc_coun()} against Natural Earth \code{iso_a3_eh}).
\item \code{coordinatecleaner}: \code{CoordinateCleaner::clean_coordinates()} with the
tests in \code{cc_tests} (country centroids, identical lon/lat, GBIF
headquarters, institutions, zeros, urban areas).
