\strong{Layers}
\itemize{
\item \code{outside_range}: farther than \code{range_buffer_km} from the range polygon.
\item \code{at_sea}: farther from land than allowed by the coordinate uncertainty,
measured to detailed land polygons; with only a water raster, the coarse
fallback reason is \code{on_water}.
\item \code{no_climate_data}: no value in the climate raster.
\item \code{built_up}, \code{cropland}, \code{ghs_dense}, \code{ghs_building_nearby}: settlements
and fields.
