\item \code{isolated_climate_outlier}: beyond \code{isolation_climate} and with fewer
than \code{min_support} other records within \code{support_radius_km}.
\item \code{small_isolated_cluster}: clusters of fewer than \code{min_cluster_n}
records (chained closer than \code{cluster_eps_km}).
\item \code{climate_limit}: beyond the hard \code{climate_limit}.
\item \code{climate_soft_limit}: beyond \code{climate_soft_limit} with no cell within
